        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is this?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VR game is a time machine, but you don't get to choose where you go. When you pull the lever it takes you somewhere random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get a date telling you where you are in time and the doors open. There's no way of predicting where you'll end up. You can't leave the time machine -  you can stick your head out, but be warned sometimes you might not want to.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Where do I go?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might end up somewhere significant or you might end up somewhere totally ordinary.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't like where you are then you pull the lever again. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in a single 2x3m room. You can use teleport and smooth locomotion to move around in the space if you would like to play sitting down. Its best played roomscale. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707810/extras/2f5324375d47244fa87714892f5ff546.poster.avif?t=1780275666\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707810/extras/2f5324375d47244fa87714892f5ff546.webm?t=1780275666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707810/extras/2f5324375d47244fa87714892f5ff546.mp4?t=1780275666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun! </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is this?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VR game is a time machine, but you don't get to choose where you go. When you pull the lever it takes you somewhere random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get a date telling you where you are in time and the doors open. There's no way of predicting where you'll end up. You can't leave the time machine -  you can stick your head out, but be warned sometimes you might not want to.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Where do I go?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might end up somewhere significant or you might end up somewhere totally ordinary.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't like where you are then you pull the lever again. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in a single 2x3m room. You can use teleport and smooth locomotion to move around in the space if you would like to play sitting down. Its best played roomscale. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707810/extras/2f5324375d47244fa87714892f5ff546.poster.avif?t=1780275666\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707810/extras/2f5324375d47244fa87714892f5ff546.webm?t=1780275666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707810/extras/2f5324375d47244fa87714892f5ff546.mp4?t=1780275666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun! </p>",
        "short_description": "This 'time machine' takes you where others won't.",
